OL,3,GNEWSANew digital check-in aims to cut
OL,4,AA&E waiting times
OL,5,
OL,6,FA new digital check-in system aimed at
OL,7,Fcutting A&E waiting times is being
OL,8,Frolled out across a number of London
OL,9,Fhospitals.
OL,11,FPatients will be able to scan a QR code
OL,12,Fon their phone and answer questions
OL,13,Fabout their symptoms, personal details
OL,14,Fand condition before seeing medical
OL,15,Fstaff.
OL,17,FThe information means potentially
OL,18,Fserious cases can be identified more
OL,19,Fquickly and helps staff prioritise
OL,20,Fpatients according to need.
OL,23,APub: 28-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
