OL,3,GNEWSANew digital check-in aims to cut
OL,4,AA&E waiting times
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe system is now operating at at
OL,7,FNorthwick Park Hospital in Harrow and
OL,8,Fwill be introduced at Ealing Hospital
OL,9,Fin October before being rolled out to
OL,10,FChelsea and Westminster, St Mary's,
OL,11,FWest Middlesex and Hillingdon
OL,12,Fhospitals.
